      <div class="col">
        <div class="info">
          <p>Ethan Park is a Data Analyst at Virturo, where he plays a crucial role in transforming raw data into actionable insights. A native of San Francisco, Ethan’s love for numbers and technology led him to pursue a career in data analysis, with a particular focus on financial services.</p>

          <h5>Education:</h5>
          <p>He holds a degree in Statistics from UC Berkeley and has a certification in Data Science from a prestigious online program.</p>

          <h5>Experience:</h5>
          <p>Ethan’s previous role at a fintech startup gave him the experience needed to handle large datasets and extract meaningful trends. At Virturo, he works closely with both the analytics and investment teams to optimize data usage, improving decision-making processes and client strategies.</p>

          <h5>Specialty:</h5>
          <p>Ethan is proficient in various analytical tools and has a knack for predictive modeling, enabling the team at Virturo to anticipate market trends and enhance operational efficiency.</p>
